ont-size:12pt;font-family:宋体\">\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;text-align:justify\">\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Hi,<u></u><u></u></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;text-align:justify\">\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"> <u></u><u></u></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;text-align:justify\">\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">I am trying to use CODEX to call CNV. But I met a question as below:<u></u><u></u></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;text-align:justify\">\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"> <u></u><u></u></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;text-align:justify\">\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">&gt; qcObj &lt;- qc(Y, sampname, chr, ref, mapp, gc, cov_thresh = c(20, 4000), length_thresh = c(20, 2000), mapp_thresh = 0.9, gc_thres20, 80))<u></u><u></u></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;text-align:justify\">\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Error in apply(Y_qc, 1, median) : dim(X) must have a positive length<u></u><u></u></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;text-align:justify\">\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"> <u></u><u></u></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;text-align:justify\">\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Can you help me to fix this problem?<u></u><u><